in-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;">  f0 : resposta ao mensurando        g0 : efeito da interferência</p><p style=" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;">  Sum1 : combina sinal útil + parcela espúria -&gt; y(t)</p></body></html> ENDCOMMENT 
